<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING GOALSCORERS IN SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING GOALSCORERS IN SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the</p>
<p>Scottish premier division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>11 - Billy Dodds (Aberdeen)</p>
<p>10 - Dean Windass (Aberdeen)</p>
<p>9 - Ally McCoist (Rangers, Jorge Cadete (Celtic)</p>
<p>6 - Andreas Thom (Celtic)</p>
<p>5 - Pierre Van Hooydonk (Celtic), Peter Van Vossen</p>
<p>(Rangers)</p>
<p>4 - Stephen Glass (Aberdeen)</p>
